    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "For the Fourier expansion, we use the same truncation mode for both the bundle and the manifold, as we can always take the maximum between the two when needed. The coefficients used in these computations are available in the GitHub repository associated with this paper [38]."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
